Package: viettelex-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         gir1.2-adw-1,
         adwaita-icon-theme
Recommends: viettelex-fcitx5 | viettelex-ibus
Description: VietTelex Vietnamese input method - settings application
 VietTelex types Vietnamese exactly like its macOS version: Telex, Simple
 Telex, VNI, free tone placement, Quick Telex, live spell-check, automatic
 English restore and context-aware decisions.
 .
 This package contains viettelex-settings, a GTK4/libadwaita application to
 change typing options, shortcuts (abbreviations) and per-application typing
 modes. Changes apply immediately to the running input method. It also
 detects Fcitx5/IBus and guides you through enabling VietTelex.

Package: libviettelex-core
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.viettelex.noengine>
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: VietTelex Vietnamese input method - typing engine
 VietTelex types Vietnamese exactly like its macOS version: Telex, Simple
 Telex, VNI, free tone placement, Quick Telex, live spell-check, automatic
 English restore and context-aware decisions.
 .
 This package contains libtelexcore, the shared typing engine (Swift, built
 with a static Swift runtime) used by the Fcitx5 and IBus frontends. It is
 installed in a private directory and is not meant for other programs. It
 also ships the input-method status icons shared by both frontends.

Package: viettelex-fcitx5
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.viettelex.noengine>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libviettelex-core (= ${binary:Version}), fcitx5
Recommends: viettelex-settings,
            fcitx5-frontend-gtk3,
            fcitx5-frontend-gtk4,
            fcitx5-frontend-qt5,
            fcitx5-frontend-qt6,
            im-config
Suggests: fcitx5-config-qt
Description: VietTelex Vietnamese input method - Fcitx5 addon
 VietTelex types Vietnamese exactly like its macOS version: Telex, Simple
 Telex, VNI, free tone placement, Quick Telex, live spell-check, automatic
 English restore and context-aware decisions.
 .
 This package contains the Fcitx5 input method addon (recommended: runs inside
 the fcitx5 process for the lowest latency). After installing, add
 "Vietnamese (VietTelex)" in the Fcitx5 configuration; no logout needed.

Package: viettelex-ibus
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.viettelex.noengine>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libviettelex-core (= ${binary:Version}), ibus
Recommends: viettelex-settings,
            ibus-gtk3,
            ibus-gtk4
Description: VietTelex Vietnamese input method - IBus engine
 VietTelex types Vietnamese exactly like its macOS version: Telex, Simple
 Telex, VNI, free tone placement, Quick Telex, live spell-check, automatic
 English restore and context-aware decisions.
 .
 This package contains the IBus engine (IBus is the default input method
 framework of Ubuntu/GNOME). After installing, run "ibus restart" and add
 Vietnamese > VietTelex under Settings > Keyboard > Input Sources.
